<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dev. Cat — Digital Craftsmanship</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400&family=Noto+Serif+JP:wght@200;400&family=DM+Sans:wght@400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --noir: #0F0F0F;
            --pearl: #F9F9F7;
            --ash: #8C8C88;
            --smoke: #E2E2DF;
            --accent: #8A9A5B; /* 弓道の静寂をイメージした落ち着いた緑（苔色） */
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
            background-color: var(--pearl);
            color: var(--noir);
            line-height: 1.8;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .serif {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 2rem 5vw;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(249, 249, 247, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            font-weight: 400;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 3rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--noir);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 10vw;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .hero-pretitle {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ash);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        /* Work Section */
        .work {
            padding: 10rem 10vw;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .section-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ash);
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .app-card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .app-info h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .app-description {
            color: var(--ash);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            max-width: 450px;
        }

        .app-visual {
            background: var(--smoke);
            aspect-ratio: 16/9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .app-visual::after {
            content: "qdBase";
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        /* Philosophy */
        .philosophy {
            padding: 10rem 10vw;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .philosophy-text {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 2;
            font-weight: 200;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            padding: 5rem 10vw;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--smoke);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }

        .footer-left h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .contact-link {
            color: var(--noir);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--noir);
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .copyright {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--ash);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .app-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            footer { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Dev. Cat</div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
            <li><a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a></li>
            <li><a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-pretitle">Developer & Artisan</div>
            <h1 class="hero-title serif">道具としての<br>デジタルを、追求する。</h1>
            <p style="color: var(--ash);">凛とした空気感と、使い手に馴染む機能性。<br>弓道の精神をデジタルプロダクトに宿します。</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="work" id="work">
        <div class="section-label">Featured Work</div>
        <div class="app-card">
            <div class="app-info">
                <h3 class="serif">qdBase</h3>
                <p class="app-description">
                    弓道の的中管理に特化した、静かで強力なツール。
                    射手の集中を妨げず、記録を「写す」ためのミニマルな設計。
                    日々の稽古に、確かな指標をもたらします。
                </p>
                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/qdbase-%E5%BC%93%E9%81%93%E3%81%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%81%AB%E7%89%B9%E5%8C%96%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA/id6754814954" class="contact-link" target="_blank">App Storeで見る</a>
            </div>
            <div class="app-visual">
                </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="philosophy" id="philosophy">
        <div class="section-label">Philosophy</div>
        <p class="philosophy-text serif">
            正射必中。正しいプロセスから、正しい結果が生まれる。<br>
            コードの一行、ピクセルの一つにまでその精神を反映させ、<br>
            時代に流されない普遍的な価値を持つアプリケーションを。
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-left">
            <h2 class="serif">Dev. Cat</h2>
            <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com" class="contact-link">Connect via Email</a>
        </div>
        <div class="copyright">
            &copy; 2026 Dev. Cat. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
